 "body": "bodies/feed-55ef3851482a.json", "engagement": 150, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-58f7e27359dd", "title": "Pimco警告：对冲基金被迫抛售以止损，美国10年期国债收益率或突破6%！", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783253", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/e7e0947c-26f1-4dfb-8d83-4049db967427.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资"], "excerpt": "全球最大债券基金Pimco发出警告，美国10年期国债收益率存在突破6%的风险，这将是该指标收益率26年来首次触及这一水平。\n\n\nPimco首席投资官Dan", "published_at": "2026-10-09T07:16:46Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-09T10:12:23Z", "body": "bodies/feed-58f7e27359dd.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-65f7f52cbc9f", "title": "报道：腾讯拟发行最高50亿美元离岸债券，中国科技巨头加速锁定AI算力", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783269", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/afce6ea0-b98a-49fd-848b-3739d2f644da.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "科技"], "excerpt": "腾讯被爆正考虑发行最高50亿美元离岸债券，成为中国头部科技公司新一轮密集融资潮中的最新案例。\n\n\n据新浪财经援引知情人士称，腾讯控股在考虑发行至多50亿美元的离岸债券。这些债券可能以美元和离岸人民币计价，最早或于本月发行。腾讯6月已通过发行长期美元和人民币债券筹集了近47亿美元资金，创其2020年以来最大发债规模，所得", "published_at": "2026-10-09T08:39:35Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-09T10:12:23Z", "body": "bodies/feed-65f7f52cbc9f.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-7b1cb0cb5953", "title": "我使用国产「个人 AI 助手」的十天｜AI 上新", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/372163", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/18/8f/188f3d33148c0c79cdc66619f02c4643.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "